"unverified software represents a security risk, as the presence of "
"unverifiable software can be a sign of tampering.</warning> Do you wish to "
"continue?"
msgid_plural ""
"The following pieces of software cannot be verified. <warning>Installing "
"unverified software represents a security risk, as the presence of "
"unverifiable software can be a sign of tampering.</warning> Do you wish to "
"continue?"
msgstr[0] ""
"Sljedeći program se ne može verifikovati. <warning>Instalacija "
"neverifikovanog softvera predstavlja sigurnosni rizik, a pristustvo takvog "
"softvera znači provalu.</warning> Želite li nastaviti?"
msgstr[1] ""
"Sljedeći programi se ne mogu verifikovati. <warning>Instalacija "
"neverifikovanog softvera predstavlja sigurnosni rizik, a pristustvo takvog "
"softvera znači provalu.</warning> Želite li nastaviti?"
msgstr[2] ""
